{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13201130","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13201130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1320113001:0":{"text":"Hmm... These are some kind of philosophical writings... Chippy can't really understand it.","source_cn":"唔……这是一些哲学笔记，好绕啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95838D86E6F382DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320113002:1":{"text":"It's as bad as what the hornleaf bear wrote. Can't make heads or tails of it...","source_cn":"怎么和叶角熊写的有得一拼，都不像人话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1BCCD042EA06839","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320113003:1":{"text":"Although the last few sentences... Seems like the writer is exploring whether or not he's still himself after transforming his body.","source_cn":"看最后几句……好像作者是在探究：换个身体后，还是不是自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4652880DCC44BF89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1320113003":{"text":"Although the last few sentences... Seems like the writer is exploring whether or not he's still himself after transforming his body.","source_cn":"看最后几句……好像作者是在探究：换个身体后，还是不是自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4652880DCC44BF89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320113004:0":{"text":"What if this hornleaf bear....","source_cn":"莫非这只叶角熊……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F638684C23437E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What if this hornleaf bear....","female":"What if this hornleaf bear....","variant_male_record_index":"145481","variant_female_record_index":"145482","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320113005:0":{"text":"Is feeding on spirits?","source_cn":"在以精神为食粮？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5477AD50BE80D022","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Is feeding on spirits?","female":"Is feeding on spirits?","variant_male_record_index":"145483","variant_female_record_index":"145484","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320113006:0":{"text":"No need to beat around the bush...","source_cn":"倒也不用这么前卫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32D262E0C7037168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320113009:1":{"text":"Oh? So... It must be...","source_cn":"嗯？难、难道——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC3FC00CEC0B2446F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh? So... It must be...","female":"Oh? So... It must be...","variant_male_record_index":"145490","variant_female_record_index":"145491","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320113010:1":{"text":"That hornleaf bear... It can't be... It can't be!","source_cn":"这叶角熊……该不会是——该不会是！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0035D96BA2590895","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That hornleaf bear... It can't be... It can't be!","female":"That hornleaf bear... It can't be... It can't be!","variant_male_record_index":"145492","variant_female_record_index":"145493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1320113010":{"text":"That hornleaf bear... It can't be... It can't be!","source_cn":"这叶角熊……该不会是——该不会是！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0035D96BA2590895","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That hornleaf bear... It can't be... It can't be!","female":"That hornleaf bear... It can't be... It can't be!","variant_male_record_index":"145492","variant_female_record_index":"145493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320113011:1":{"text":"It really is a transformed human!","source_cn":"真的是人变的吗！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9AE32231C3EF58ED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It really is a transformed human!","female":"It really is a transformed human!","variant_male_record_index":"145494","variant_female_record_index":"145495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320113012:1":{"text":"Hey bear! Were you a human?","source_cn":"叶角熊……你原本是人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEFC792B57222CDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320113013:1":{"text":"Nod your head if yes.","source_cn":"是的话，你就点点头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF1F929610E462B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320113014:0":{"text":"Grrr...","source_cn":"呜……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757EE9C1431337BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320113015:1":{"text":"How'd you get turned into a bear?!","source_cn":"你怎么变成叶角熊了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE5F78733199C15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:1320113016:0":{"text":"The hornleaf bear is actually a person?! You prepare a spell to turn it back.","source_cn":"这只叶角熊居然是个人？！这可真是奇怪……你们准备施法将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7DE6F79520786A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:13020132:0":{"text":"You use magic to try to undo the transformation on the hornleaf bear, and indeed, you turn him back into a human.","source_cn":"你用魔法试着解除叶角熊身上的变形术，果然将他变回了人类。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D8840F17507DAA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"It's a transformed human?","source_cn":"是人变的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB24F3DC94227B9D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's a transformed human?","fema